  "description": "The first prince of the demon realm, Asus, does not follow the will of the demon king and lives a life of debauchery and is exiled to the human world. In order to return to the Demon Realm, Asus tries to regain the lost power by mixing his body with a human man, but he struggles because there is no man who can handle him. \n\nJust before he collapses due to lack of magical power, Asth finds Gaji-Nam, who is returning home with a Bible. Asth then begs him to treat him once because he thinks he is about to die...\n\n\"Fine, I'll do it for you, so come with me to repent!\"\n\n(Source: BOMTOON, translated)",
